      right here. Upload the DMG as a GitHub Release asset first so its
      download URL matches the <enclosure url>.

      Example of what one release looks like:

      <item>
        <title>0.14.0</title>
        <pubDate>Sat, 19 Jul 2026 10:00:00 +0700</pubDate>
        <sparkle:version>0.14.0</sparkle:version>
        <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
        <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
        <description><![CDATA[
          <ul><li>New: clipboard sequential paste (⌃⌘↓)</li></ul>
        ]]></description>
        <enclosure
          url="https://github.com/you/pspsps/releases/download/v0.14.0/pspsps-0.14.0.dmg"
          sparkle:edSignature="BASE64_SIGNATURE_FROM_package.sh"
          length="12345678"
          type="application/octet-stream" />
      </item>
    -->

